# {{distribution}}

A snapdelta plugin: {{kinds}}.

```bash
uv sync                      # install the plugin and snapdelta in .venv
uv run snapdelta plugins     # the plugins of this package are in the list
uv run snapdelta doctor      # each plugin passes the checks of its interface
uv run pytest                # the contract tests of snapdelta.testing
```

Each module under `src/{{package}}/` holds one plugin, and `pyproject.toml` declares it as an entry point: snapdelta finds it there. The guide of each kind of plugin is in https://github.com/antoinekh/snapdelta/blob/main/docs/plugins.md.
